Description: Tuning and Analysis Utilities profiling package (gnu15 + impi, OpenHPC)
 TAU is a program and performance analysis tool framework for high-performance
 parallel and distributed computing. It provides a suite of static and dynamic
 tools for performance instrumentation, measurement, analysis, and visualization.
 Built with the gnu15 compiler family and impi MPI stack.
 .
 This package is part of the OpenHPC project.
